{"id":"n24820-1-7","stage":3,"title":"장모 · 丈母娘","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24820-1-7-1","ko":"아까 결혼식에서 민준이의 장모를 처음 보았는데 신부랑 많이 닮았더구나.","zh":"刚才在婚礼上第一次见到敏俊的岳母，发现她和新娘长得真像啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼식에서","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼식에서","audio":"/audio/2c95aaf130dad9fbfe2c.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이의","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이의","audio":"/audio/b279178de14757126dfc.mp3"}},{"text":"장모를","meaning":"丈母娘，岳母","explanation":"장모：丈母娘，岳母；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장모","audio":"/audio/2ae0a585df43df2775ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24820","senseId":"1","lemma":"장모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장모를","audio":"/audio/8bc5d8f1f734959692b7.mp3"}},{"text":"처음","meaning":"第一次，初次","explanation":"처음：第一次，初次。","readings":[{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17170","senseId":"1","lemma":"처음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처음","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3"}},{"text":"보았는데","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보았는데","audio":"/audio/d88bc89d8c0ebef25463.mp3"}},{"text":"신부랑","meaning":"新娘，新娘子","explanation":"신부：新娘，新娘子；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"신부","audio":"/audio/2ec5f43408d90211d6d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65342","senseId":"1","lemma":"신부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신부랑","audio":"/audio/9f69adfcca074b51275b.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"닮았더구나.","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더구나：回顾亲历的情况并表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮았더구나","audio":"/audio/6149d25798f06f7dc01d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"2ae0a585df43df27","term":"장모","zh":"丈母娘，岳母","audio":"/audio/2ae0a585df43df2775ff.mp3","entryId":"24820","definition":"妻子的母亲。","pronunciation":["장ː모"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/91390eadfad43d09c458.mp3","entryId":"17170","definition":"在顺序或时间上排在最前面。","pronunciation":["처음"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，见，见面","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"与别人相见。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2ec5f43408d90211","term":"신부","zh":"新娘，新娘子","audio":"/audio/2ec5f43408d90211d6d3.mp3","entryId":"65342","definition":"现在刚结婚